return {
    ["        虽然它的能力已不足巅峰的十分之一，但毕竟曾是我最骄傲的设计，必须尽早将它压制封印……小家伙们，交给你们了，不要再让绯红降临在大地上。"] = "        Although its power is less than a tenth of its peak, it was, after all, my proudest design. It must be suppressed and sealed as soon as possible... Little ones, I leave it to you. Do not let the crimson descend upon the earth again.",
