    ["<Assistant_Title1>【推荐方案】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>在各个养成系统中，点击<Assistant_System>推荐方案</>按钮即可前往推荐方案系统，使用推荐方案系统可以将系统和大神玩家推荐的方案，根据自身当前养成状况，一键运用到自身方案中。\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入推荐方案系统后，可以点击一键使用，也可以点击各个养成模块右上角的复制按钮，将成组或单独的套路运用到自身当前的方案上。在方案界面点击左下角的<Assistant_System>分享</>按钮，即可将自身当前装配的方案分享给其他非凡者。其他非凡者可通过分享码或分享链接<Assistant_System>导入</>分享的方案。\n<Assistant_Title2>覆盖说明：</>覆盖后的方案为根据推荐的方案和角色当前的养成计算后的<Assistant_Red>智能搭配</>，并自动为角色装配合适的非凡物质。只有<Assistant_Red>同途径</>的非凡者直接可以进行方案的分享、导入和覆盖。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[非凡评分]|502}，{SendAnswer:[非凡方案]|508}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Recommended Builds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Description: </>In various cultivation systems, click the <Assistant_System>Recommended Build</> button to go to the Recommended Build system. You can use this system to apply builds recommended by the system and top players to your own setup with one click, based on your current cultivation status.\n<Assistant_Title2> Usage Guide: </>After entering the Recommended Build system, you can click \"Use One-Click\" or click the copy button in the top right corner of each cultivation module to apply sets or individual tactics to your current build. Click the <Assistant_System>Share</> button in the bottom left corner of the build interface to share your currently equipped build with other Beyonders. Other Beyonders can <Assistant_System>import</> shared builds via share codes or links.\n<Assistant_Title2> Overwrite Description: </>The overwritten build is an <Assistant_Red>intelligent combination</> calculated based on the recommended build and the character's current cultivation, and it will automatically equip suitable Beyonder materials for the character. Only Beyonders of the <Assistant_Red>same Pathway</> can directly share, import, and overwrite builds.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Beyonder Rating]|502}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Build]|508}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【星盘的裁断】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得星盘的裁断套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Judgment of the Star Chart] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Judgment of the Star Chart set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔色布艺・精巧花边・温婉日间裙\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Soft-colored Fabric/Exquisite Lace/Gentle Day Dress\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best time at the beginning of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷静，冷静……雷克斯习惯于钻法律的漏洞，我得抓住这一点。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Calm down, calm down... Rex is used to exploiting legal loopholes, I have to seize on that.) </>",
    ["<Title>神选席位</>\n战略服势力对战阶段，神选席位由<Highlight>每周排名结算席位</>与<Highlight>最终排名结算席位</>共同组成。每周将根据战略服各势力的周排名，以及俱乐部在所属势力内的排名发放席位，排名越高，可获得的席位越多；战略服结算时，将根据各势力的最终排名，为势力内俱乐部发放最终排名结算席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>奖励内容</>\n神选奖励包括<Highlight>战略服专属外观奖励、养成道具、苏勒、绑定金镑</>等。\n\n<Title>限时神降</>\n战略服结算时，最终排名第一的势力中，四个俱乐部的<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可获得限时30天的神降时装<Highlight>铁与血之歌</>。\n\n<Title>奖励发放</>\n奖励将于<Highlight>战略服胜者宣言大会结束后</>统一发放。"] = "<Title>Divine Selection Seats</>\nDuring the strategic server faction battle phase, Divine Selection Seats are composed of <Highlight>weekly ranking settlement seats</> and <Highlight>final ranking settlement seats</>. Every week, seats will be distributed based on the weekly ranking of each faction on the strategic server and the Club's ranking within its faction; the higher the ranking, the more seats can be obtained. Upon strategic server settlement, final ranking settlement seats will be distributed to Clubs within the faction based on the final ranking of each faction. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n\n<Title>Reward Content</>\nDivine Selection rewards include <Highlight>strategic server exclusive cosmetic rewards, cultivation items, Sol, bound Gold Pounds</>, etc. \n\n<Title>Limited-Time Divine Descent</>\nUpon strategic server settlement, the <Highlight>President, Vice President, and Directors</> of the four Clubs in the faction ranked first overall can obtain the limited-time 30-day Divine Descent outfit <Highlight>Song of Iron and Blood</>. \n\n<Title>Reward Distribution</>\nRewards will be distributed uniformly <Highlight>after the strategic server Victor's Declaration ceremony ends</>.",
